            "sid": "JER 51:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alimu Ekapolon atemar isicani iŋes Babilon ka ŋituŋa ŋulu iboiyete alo Babilon iteete iyes, esicani ayoŋ ikes aŋuna ka aronis a ŋina apotu ikes kitiyata Sion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
